WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.087
Profiles: choosing roles for your work.

2
00:00:03.087 --> 00:00:08.304
Choose roles, compare them with access
levels, and switch between intake,

3
00:00:08.304 --> 00:00:10.848
case work and review profiles.

4
00:00:12.425 --> 00:00:15.910
Riley handles both intake
and case work in Maryland.

5
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.861
Open My profiles using the
profile box in the header.

6
00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:24.836
The administrator assigned two
roles: Intake clerk and Case manager.

7
00:00:24.836 --> 00:00:30.126
Both are in Riley's master profile,
at Maryland and everything under it.

8
00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:33.825
A role supplies permissions
for particular duties.

9
00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:39.364
A profile chooses which of your assigned
roles to use, and where to use them.

10
00:00:39.722 --> 00:00:42.379
Place sets where a grant applies.

11
00:00:42.379 --> 00:00:44.795
Role sets the permitted tasks.

12
00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:50.671
Access limits those permissions to
reading, writing, or full access.

13
00:00:51.035 --> 00:00:54.062
The Role list comes from
your master profile.

14
00:00:54.062 --> 00:00:57.559
If a needed role is missing,
ask your administrator;

15
00:00:57.559 --> 00:01:00.851
creating a profile
cannot assign it to you.

16
00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:06.338
For intake duties, choose Maryland,
Intake clerk, and Full access.

17
00:01:06.338 --> 00:01:10.003
Keep everything under this place selected.

18
00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:14.005
Full access still stays
within the role's permissions.

19
00:01:14.005 --> 00:01:18.449
It does not make an Intake clerk
a supervisor or an administrator.

20
00:01:18.449 --> 00:01:19.994
Save the profile.

21
00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:25.892
Create a second profile for case duties,
using the same Maryland place and Full

22
00:01:25.892 --> 00:01:29.170
access, but choose Case manager for Role.

23
00:01:33.436 --> 00:01:37.674
Case manager includes case
editing and investigation work.

24
00:01:37.674 --> 00:01:41.692
Intake clerk includes file
upload and held-record work.

25
00:01:41.692 --> 00:01:43.700
Save the case profile.

26
00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:47.335
Choose Use beside Maryland intake duties.

27
00:01:47.335 --> 00:01:52.676
The header confirms the active
profile; no sign-out is needed.

28
00:01:53.039 --> 00:01:58.588
The Intake menu is available for
uploading files and handling held records.

29
00:01:58.943 --> 00:02:01.112
Switch to Maryland case duties.

30
00:02:01.112 --> 00:02:06.709
The place and access level stay the same,
but the Intake menu disappears because

31
00:02:06.709 --> 00:02:10.187
Case manager lacks those
intake permissions.

32
00:02:10.548 --> 00:02:14.180
For a review session,
create Maryland case review.

33
00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:18.867
Keep Case manager and the same
place, but choose Read only.

34
00:02:23.451 --> 00:02:26.944
Read only removes writing
permissions from that role.

35
00:02:26.944 --> 00:02:30.766
It is useful when checking
records without making changes.

36
00:02:30.766 --> 00:02:32.879
Save and use this profile.

37
00:02:33.239 --> 00:02:36.668
People and Work queues
remain available for review.

38
00:02:36.668 --> 00:02:41.639
The role is still Case manager;
Access is what limits it to reading.

39
00:02:41.991 --> 00:02:44.527
A profile can combine roles too.

40
00:02:44.527 --> 00:02:49.602
Return to My profiles and create
Maryland intake and cases.

41
00:02:51.818 --> 00:02:57.465
In the first row, choose Maryland and
Intake clerk, with Read and write without

42
00:02:57.465 --> 00:02:58.865
delete.

43
00:02:59.239 --> 00:03:04.872
In the second row, choose the same
Maryland place, but Case manager,

44
00:03:04.872 --> 00:03:08.585
also with Read and write without delete.

45
00:03:08.942 --> 00:03:10.507
The grants add together.

46
00:03:10.507 --> 00:03:15.333
Both sets of permissions apply; a
read-only grant would not cancel writing

47
00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:18.538
allowed by another
grant at the same place.

48
00:03:18.902 --> 00:03:22.342
Every grant must fit
within your master profile.

49
00:03:22.342 --> 00:03:26.826
Check the master summary, then
save the combined profile.

50
00:03:27.188 --> 00:03:29.235
Use the combined profile.

51
00:03:29.235 --> 00:03:35.951
Intake is available again, alongside case
work, because this profile includes both

52
00:03:35.951 --> 00:03:36.951
roles.

53
00:03:37.197 --> 00:03:42.012
Choose the profile that fits today's
duties, and check its name in the header.

54
00:03:42.012 --> 00:03:46.177
Use Master profile to return to
everything you were assigned.

55
00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:52.436
In this video you chose assigned roles for
intake and case duties at the same place,

56
00:03:52.436 --> 00:03:55.524
used Read only to reduce
the permissions of a role,

57
00:03:55.524 --> 00:04:00.283
and combined roles in one profile and
checked the header when switching.
